Levels marking

Level 1 **(1–3 marks) **
Statements including limited detail which describe the problems of global warming. 
e.g. flooding = L1

Level 2 **(4–6 marks) **
More developed statements which describe the problems of global warming. 
e.g. flooding of low lying/coastal land = L2 
e.g. ice melts and sea level increases = L2 
Note: Max. 5 if no place references. Max. 6 if one place reference.

Level 3 **(7 marks) **
Comprehensive and accurate statements which describe the problems of global warming, including some place references. Must refer to two place references.

